ignoreregex =
```

### Jail :

`/etc/fail2ban/jail.local`

```txt
[nginx-limit-req]
enabled = true
port = http,https
logpath = /var/log/nginx/error.log
maxretry = 5
findtime = 30
bantime = 600
```

